t to develop a personalized treatment plan that is tailored to your specific needs and preferences.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar works extensively with her patients to ensure the right care is provided to them. She conducts a thorough evaluation, including a physical examination, imaging studies, and a comprehensive medical history, to identify the root cause of your TMJ pain and recommend appropriate treatment options.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Trigger point massage and jaw exercises can offer promising avenues to relieve stubborn TMJ pain and improve the overall functionality of your jaw. If you are struggling with TMJ pain, do not lose hope, incorporate the right strategies in your routine and take the right steps to manage your pain and soon you will reclaim a life free from persistent jaw discomfort.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Just know that the path toward <a href=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/how-to-relieve-tmj-pain-at-home\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/how-to-relieve-tmj-pain-at-home\/\">relieving TMJ pain<\/a> is a journey and requires patience, consistency, and experimentation to find out what works best for you. And this is one of the important reasons why it is important to have the right guide with you in your journey. Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar has been an effective guide to many such patients and has helped them in their healing process. Start with a quick consultation by calling her at 8248388593.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you are exploring self-care techniques or seeking guidance from an expert, know that relief is possible and you are not alone. Keep exploring, keep motivating yourself, and keep prioritizing your health and happiness.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Take Care and Godspeed!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Try Trigger Point Massage For TMJ Pain FAQs<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Who is the best TMJ specialist in the country?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar is one of the best <a href=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/tmj-specialists-in-india\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/tmj-specialists-in-india\/\">TMJ pain specialists in India<\/a> with more than 15 years of experience in this field.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What is TMJ pain, and what are its common symptoms?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TMJ pain is discomfort in the temporomandibular joint, with common symptoms including jaw stiffness, clicking sounds, difficulty opening or closing the mouth fully, jaw tenderness, and associated headaches or earaches.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How do trigger points contribute to TMJ pain, and how can trigger point massage help alleviate it?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Trigger points in jaw muscles can worsen TMJ pain. Trigger point massage targets these areas, promoting relaxation and providing relief.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What are effective jaw exercises for managing TMJ pain, and how often should they be done?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Range of motion exercises, strengthening, and stretching can help. These should be done regularly, ideally daily or as recommended by a healthcare professional.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>When should I seek professional help for stubborn TMJ pain, and what treatments are available?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Seek help if pain persists or worsens, or if there are severe symptoms like lockjaw or chronic headaches. Treatment options may include oral splints, physical therapy, medications, or surgery.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Are trigger point massage and jaw exercises suitable for everyone with TMJ pain, or are there any contraindications to consider?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While generally beneficial, it&#8217;s important to consult a healthcare professional before starting. They can assess your needs and address any potential risks or contraindications.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>In this article, we will cover details about stubborn TMJ pain and how trigger point massages and jaw exercises can help you get better. But these are just initial remedies that can be undertaken, in case of any minor or stubborn TMJ pain, book an appointment with a TMJ specialist right away. Prof. Dr. Dhivya [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[48],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4372","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-tmj"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4372","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4372"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4372\/revisions"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4372"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4372"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4372"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}